		},
		{
			"id": "feat_timeline",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "Comedy_OS_Note_Taker_Vault/42_Drag_And_Drop_Modular_Setlist_Timeline.md",
			"x": -900,
			"y": 700,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 280
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_header",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# 🔴 Destructive (\"Bad\") Beliefs That Stall Careers\n*Cognitive distortions & ego traps that cause amateur attrition (Kill Tony research, veteran debriefs)*",
			"x": 900,
			"y": -460,
			"width": 1600,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_note",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "UX/User Research/Beliefs/Destructive_Beliefs.md",
			"x": 900,
			"y": -310,
			"width": 780,
			"height": 520,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_checklist",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 🛑 Destructive Beliefs Checklist (FigJam Sticky Notes)\n\n- **\"I'll get good on stage / wing it\"** *(destroys eye contact & pacing)*\n- **\"If I heal my trauma I won't be funny anymore\"** *(burnout trap)*\n- **\"Scripting is not authentic comedy\"** *(musical rehearsal is required)*\n- **\"If audience doesn't laugh, they're dumb\"** *(external blame trap)*\n- **\"If audience laughs, joke is good\"** *(clapter / cheap trick rut)*\n- **\"Comedy is not a real job\"** *(craft vs hobby confusion)*\n- **\"Successful comics are just lucky\"** *(ignoring 10,000 reps)*\n- **\"You must write every day\"** *(guilt vs sustainable rhythm)*\n- **\"Listening to own tapes is cringe/unbearable\"** *(#1 growth bottleneck)*\n- **\"Too late for me to start / too old\"** *(fear of beginner status)*\n- **\"Asking for feedback makes you look weak\"** *(isolation trap)*",
			"x": 1720,
			"y": -310,
			"width": 780,
			"height": 520,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_b1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 1. Tape Avoidance / Cringe Barrier\n- \"Listening to myself bomb is too humiliating.\"\n- #1 career bottleneck; voice memos rot unopened.\n- **Addressed by:** Whisper ASR Diff & Set Tape Chat",
			"x": 850,
			"y": 270,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_b2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 2. External Blame Trap\n- \"The room was dead; the audience is dumb.\"\n- Blinds comic to weak setup, missing context & pacing.\n- **Addressed by:** Objective DSP Decibel Logging",
			"x": 1230,
			"y": 270,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_b3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 3. Wing-It Delusion\n- \"I don't need to memorize; I'll riff or read notes.\"\n- Destroys eye contact, cadence & authority.\n- **Addressed by:** Setlist Timeline & Dropped Tag Alerts",
			"x": 1610,
			"y": 270,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_b4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 4. Clapter & Cheap Laugh Trap\n- \"Every laugh means the material is making me better.\"\n- Addicted to easy crowd pandering & local hits.\n- **Addressed by:** Tier-A Roar vs Polite Chuckle Isolation",
			"x": 1990,
			"y": 270,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_b5",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 5. Tortured Artist Myth\n- \"If I heal my trauma, I'll lose my edge.\"\n- Superstition leading to burnout & substance paralysis.\n- **Status:** Discussion point (Ghost Mode / Wellness)",
			"x": 2370,
			"y": 270,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_b6",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 6. Vulnerability as Weakness\n- Putting on an aggressive shock-jock mask.\n- Audience turns hostile against fake posturing.\n- **Addressed by:** Delivery Notation Engine (`🗣️`, `🤸`)",
			"x": 850,
			"y": 470,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_b7",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 7. Bombing is Avoidable\n- Terrified of dead air; avoiding workshop bits.\n- Stagnation in safe comfort routines.\n- **Addressed by:** Composure Telemetry & Skid Recovery",
			"x": 1230,
			"y": 470,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_b8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 8. Reference & Gimmick Blindspots\n- \"The audience knows the reference\" / Prop crutch.\n- Expecting audience to read minds without context.\n- **Addressed by:** Context Tagging & Purist Craft Policy",
			"x": 1610,
			"y": 470,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_b9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 9. Stagnant Set Trap\n- \"Editing is optional; bits that work never get cut.\"\n- Relying on old hits stops second hour creation.\n- **Addressed by:** Living Objects State Machine (Retirement)",
			"x": 1990,
			"y": 470,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bad_b10",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### 10. Stealing & Isolation Trap\n- Stealing jokes / Asking for feedback makes you weak.\n- Reputational ruin & artistic dead-ends.\n- **Addressed by:** Bit Cryptographic Provenance & AI Pitching",
			"x": 2370,
			"y": 470,
			"width": 340,
			"height": 160,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "feat_whisper",
			"type": "file",
